stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Attached: attach `message.participant-receipts`、`message.timeline`、`message.thread-detail`
  Attached --> Ready: V2 snapshot applied
  Ready --> Pending: 单条可见、打开回执或点击已收到
  Pending --> Ready: admission rejected
  Pending --> Failed: HTTP/WS/Persist/action rejected
  Failed --> Pending: retry from current ActionBinding
  Pending --> Ready: matching causation Frame committed
  Ready --> Resync: epoch/revision gap or cache failure
  Resync --> Ready: authoritative snapshot
  Ready --> [*]: detach
  note right of Ready
    读者列表、当前消息读态和线程详情一致；HostObservation 不直接伪造已读成功
  end note
